WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.033
-Welcome back
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:05.434
It is time to play
Egg Roulette,

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:06.767
but I'm gonna need some help.

00:00:06.767 --> 00:00:09.567
Her new documentary,
"Selena Gomez: My Mind and Me,"

00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:11.901
is available now
on Apple TV Plus.

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:14.801
Please welcome Selena Gomez!

00:00:14.801 --> 00:00:16.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:21.701
Thank you for coming.

00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:23.968
Higgins, would you like
to explain how this works?

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:25.234
-Yes, James.

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:26.434
[ Laughter ]
-Oh!

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:28.834
-In my hand,
I have one dozen eggs.

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:30.300
-Ohh.
-Oh, God.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.501
-Eight of them
have been hard-boiled,

00:00:32.501 --> 00:00:34.434
and four of them are still raw.

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:37.000
You and Selena
will take turns selecting

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.033
one egg at a time,
smashing it upon your head.

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:41.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:45.234
You won't know which eggs
are hard-boiled or raw!

00:00:45.234 --> 00:00:48.467
Once you choose an egg, you must
smash that egg upon your head.

00:00:48.467 --> 00:00:50.100
-Okay.
-No put backs.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.434
-No put backs. Gotcha.

00:00:51.434 --> 00:00:55.901
-First one to smash two eggs
upon their head loses.

00:00:55.901 --> 00:01:00.400
Selena, would you choose
the first egg?

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:03.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:05.467
-Be careful! Be careful!

00:01:05.467 --> 00:01:07.834
-Stop it. You make me mad.

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:09.567
This is the things
you make me do?

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:12.167
-Good luck!

00:01:12.167 --> 00:01:13.868
-How does it feel?
Do you feel confident?

00:01:13.868 --> 00:01:15.133
-I don't -- I don't know.
-Okay.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.033
-Okay.

00:01:17.033 --> 00:01:18.367
-Ohh!

00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:20.167
-Ohh! You're lucky.

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:22.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:22.501 --> 00:01:25.367
-James!

00:01:25.367 --> 00:01:26.567
No!

00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:27.801
[ Suspenseful music plays ]

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:29.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.534 --> 00:01:33.501
♪♪

00:01:33.501 --> 00:01:35.501
-Ooh!

00:01:35.501 --> 00:01:37.033
You can do it.

00:01:37.033 --> 00:01:39.100
-I don't have a good feeling
about this one.

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:40.767
-Go!

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.868
-Can I --
-No! Do it!

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:44.901
♪♪

00:01:44.901 --> 00:01:46.100
[ Selena laughs ]

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:47.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:47.968 --> 00:01:49.100
-Ohh!

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:51.267
[ Sad tuba plays ]

00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:53.200
-Yes!

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:55.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:55.534 --> 00:01:58.434
-I knew it. I knew it.
I knew it!

00:01:58.434 --> 00:02:00.767
-Yep.
-Gosh.

00:02:00.767 --> 00:02:01.968
Good luck.

00:02:01.968 --> 00:02:05.267
-Aah! [ Laughs ] Okay.

00:02:05.267 --> 00:02:09.000
Oh, I don't feel good
about this one either. Aah!

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.100
-You don't?
-Why did I agree to this?!

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:12.701
-I'm so happy you came on.
-Okay, okay.

00:02:12.701 --> 00:02:14.767
Do you have an event tonight
after the show?

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:15.968
-No.
-Oh, perfect.

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:17.834
-Oh, God. Aah!

00:02:17.834 --> 00:02:19.000
-Oh, my God.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:23.400
-Aah! Aah! What the --

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:26.133
-That was the nicest crack.
You just did a little --

00:02:26.133 --> 00:02:28.534
-Sorry, sorry.
-You just did a little cracking.

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:29.767
Look at that.

00:02:29.767 --> 00:02:31.868
Now you have, like,
an Elvis spit curl.

00:02:31.868 --> 00:02:34.868
-Great.
This is so -- so sexy.

00:02:34.868 --> 00:02:36.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.434 --> 00:02:37.734
-Ooh, this is good.
It's a tie game.

00:02:37.734 --> 00:02:39.434
-Tie game. 1-1.

00:02:39.434 --> 00:02:41.100
-But that one's suspicious.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:43.834
-Aah.

00:02:43.834 --> 00:02:46.601
Oh, no. You -- Ohh.

00:02:46.601 --> 00:02:47.968
Yeah.

00:02:47.968 --> 00:02:49.868
-♪ Ba da-da da-da, da da-da ♪
-Do it!

00:02:49.868 --> 00:02:51.133
-♪ Ha la-la da-da ♪

00:02:51.133 --> 00:02:52.400
Ooh.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:54.968 --> 00:02:56.234
[ Laughs ]

00:02:56.234 --> 00:02:57.601
-I'll do a good one this time.

00:02:57.601 --> 00:03:00.167
-♪ Da da-da da-da,
mm-mm, deh-deh ♪

00:03:00.167 --> 00:03:02.267
[ Suspenseful music plays ]

00:03:02.267 --> 00:03:04.367
-Oh, I don't feel good
about this one either.

00:03:04.367 --> 00:03:06.834
-This is for the win!
-Okay.

00:03:06.834 --> 00:03:08.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:10.868
[ Sad tuba plays ]

00:03:10.868 --> 00:03:13.567
I did that for you!
-You did that for me.

00:03:13.567 --> 00:03:17.434
Thank you so much.
Selena Gomez! The greatest!

00:03:17.434 --> 00:03:19.434
We love having you on the show!
-I love you!

00:03:19.434 --> 00:03:21.934
-We're talking to Selena
after the break.

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:23.801
Stick around, everybody!
Selena Gomez!

00:03:23.801 --> 00:03:25.133
-Aah!

